    summary: "Phase 3 placebo-controlled trial of 717 patients aged 18 to 59 with newly diagnosed FLT3-mutated AML (ITD or TKD) randomised to midostaurin or placebo with daunorubicin-cytarabine induction, high-dose cytarabine consolidation and a year of maintenance.\n\nMedian overall survival was 74.7 months with midostaurin against 25.6 months with placebo (hazard ratio 0.78), with benefit across FLT3 subtypes and in patients who went on to transplant.",
